
Welcome to the GitKraken CLI — an AI-powered, premium developer experience that enhances Git workflows across any repository.
⚠️ You’re using the public preview of the new GitKraken CLI. Features may evolve before general availability.

Usage:
  gk [flags]
  gk [command]

AUTHENTICATING
  auth         Authenticate with the GitKraken platform
  provider     Add or remove provider tokens
  whoami       Show the authenticated GitKraken user, active organization, and connected providers

CORE COMMANDS
  agents       List AI agents and their integration status
  ai           Use AI in the CLI
  graph        Display commit graph in current repository
  issue        Manage your issues
  mcp          Start a local MCP server for your favorite MCP client to interact with
  organization Manage your Gitkraken organizations
  pr           Manage your pull requests
  repo         Work with repositories
  work         Interact with your work. Alias: 'w'
  workspace    Interact with your workspaces. Alias: 'ws'
